{"unit_id":"kaelorvyn__dsh-archived-sessions#feature-1","repo":"kaelorvyn/dsh-archived-sessions","commit":"1fbaaecf249dbc051977de8cc8964406cef03e57","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-archived-sessions 的功能「恢复会话」：在已归档会话设置页点击单行恢复，或多选后批量恢复；界面通过宿主 /unarchive 命令从归档集合移除会话。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:314-315","lib/client.js:382-383","lib/index.js:211-230"]}
